export anchor BentoTilesStyle:
    number: 13
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Bento tiles
    idea: A modern product page, where the dashboard is a bento grid of softly tinted tiles in different sizes, with big rounded corners and large heavy numbers that make the key facts land first.
    base: light
    palette:
        page: #f6f5f2, the page, inner chips, fields and the nav track
        tile: #ffffff, the header bar and plain tiles
        lilac: #efeaff, the hero tile
        mint: #e2f6ec, the active projects tile
        sky: #e4efff, the due this week tile
        sun: #fff5d4, the hours tile
        peach: #ffede1, the user avatar and accents
        text: #17161c, text and the dark hero button
        muted: #57546a, tile titles and meta text
        line: #e6e3ec, progress ring tracks and activity chip borders
        violet: #5b3fd9, the primary button, this week's bars, progress rings and the focus ring
        violetDark: #4529b8, the hero figure, links and primary hover
        violetSoft: #9283d8, last week's bars
        green: #17663f, the On track check
        amber: #8a4a00, the At risk diamond
        red: #b4232a, the Behind cross and the notification badge
    type:
        System sans, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial, sans-serif. Sizes are a 168px black weight hero figure,
        64px black weight tile figures, a 32px extra bold greeting, 16px
        extra bold project names, 15px regular body, 15px bold muted tile
        titles and 13px extra bold status words. Large type is set tight,
        from minus 0.03em to minus 0.06em.
    layout:
        A white header bar with 24px corners holds the wordmark with a four
        colour square logo, the nav as a segmented pill track, a search pill,
        the New project button, a notifications square and the avatar. Below
        it a four column bento grid with 16px gaps. A two by two lilac hero
        tile holds the greeting, the date, a giant 4 with tasks are overdue
        and a dark Review overdue tasks button. Mint, sky and sun tiles hold
        active projects, due this week and hours. A tall white chart tile
        on the right spans three rows and shows horizontal bars per day. A
        wide projects tile shows six chips in two columns, each with a
        progress ring, and a wide activity tile shows six chips in three
        columns. Below 1180px the grid has two columns, and below 860px the
        tiles stack in reading order with the small figure tiles in pairs.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px between tiles, 24px tile padding and 8px between inner chips.
    density: Medium. A few big tiles, each fact with room of its own.
    corners: 24px on tiles and the header bar, 18px on inner chips, 16px on buttons and fields, 14px on avatars and fully round chart bars.
    borders: None on tiles. Only activity chips carry a 1px #e6e3ec border.
    shadows: None, apart from a faint 1px lift on the current nav pill.
    icons:
        Rounded line icons with a 2.2 stroke, sized to the text, set in 40px
        frosted white squares on the figure tiles. Status is a bold check, a
        hollow diamond or a cross beside a bold word, with a key under the
        projects. Progress is a 52px ring with the percentage inside.
    focus: A 3px violet outline offset 3px. A focused field turns white with a violet border and a 4px soft violet halo.
    tone: Confident and short, such as Good morning, Mara, All 6 projects and See everything.
